X: 1
T: Por una Cabeza
C: Carlos Gardel (music), Alfredo Le Pera (lyrics), 1935
O: Argentina
R: Tango
N: "By a head", a horse-racing phrase. A tango canción written for the 1935 film
N: Tango Bar; Gardel and Le Pera both died in a plane crash later that year.
N: Melody and chords from the flute-and-piano setting on flutetunes.com, chords
N: read from its piano part. Note values doubled from the 2/4 source so the
N: moving value is an eighth. Transposed down a fifth from A major / A minor
N: to D major / D minor to fit the recorder (range E4 to A5).
N: The second-time ending is shortened to half a bar so the loop pays back
N: the half-bar pickup; the source holds the last note a little longer.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=120
M: 4/4
K: D
